      "heading": "题目描述",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>爱因斯坦出了一道这样的数学题：有一条长阶梯，若每步跨 <span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span> 阶，则最最后剩一阶，若每步跨 <span class=\"katex math inline\">3</span> 阶，则最后剩 <span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span> 阶，若每步跨 <span class=\"katex math inline\">5</span> 阶，则最后剩 <span class=\"katex math inline\">4</span> 阶，若每步跨 <span class=\"katex math inline\">6</span> 阶则最后剩 <span class=\"katex math inline\">5</span> 阶。</p>\n<p>只有每次跨 <span class=\"katex math inline\">7</span> 阶，最后才正好一阶不剩。</p>\n<p>请问这条阶梯最少共有多少阶？</p>\n</div>            </div>",
